{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-10-05 16:15:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA PLEDGES UP TO $100,000 TO SUPPORT HURRICANE IAN RELIEF EFFORTS', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO , OCT. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA (NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED A CONTRIBUTION OF UP TO $100,000 TO THE AMERICAN RED CROSS TO ASSIST RELIEF EFFORTS AND COMMUNITIES RECOVERING FROM DEVASTATION CAUSED BY HURRICANE IAN. A $50,000 CONTRIBUTION WILL HELP PROVIDE CRITICAL SERVICES, EMERGENCY SHELTER AND SUPPLIES IN THE AREAS IMPACTED BY THE STORM.'}